    "settings.android.uninstall.message": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approximately %@ will be removed. The OKVideoMac Android session will be stopped first. Android sign-in data, user-data backups, private keys, and your external SDK selection will be kept. External SDK files will not be deleted."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预计清理约 %@。将先停止 OKVideoMac Android 会话。Android 登录数据、用户数据备份、私有密钥和外部 SDK 选择将保留，不会删除外部 SDK 文件。"}}}},
